@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-11  Save and submit a quiz or assessment
' Requirements: ASSESS-01 ASSESS-02 ASSESS-03 ASSESS-04 ASSESS-05 QUIZ-01 QUIZ-02 QUIZ-03 QUIZ-04 QUIZ-05 QUIZ-06 QUIZ-07 QUIZ-08 PROGRESS-01 PROGRESS-02 PROGRESS-03 REWARD-01 REWARD-02 CONTENT-06 DATA-01 P-03 P-04
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Open quiz or shared assessment
S --> U: Resume unfinished attempt, or start one on applicable revision
loop While answering
  U -> S: Save changed answer
  S --> U: Indicate saved or waiting-to-save state
end
U -> S: Submit completed answers
alt Some questions are unanswered
  S --> U: Keep attempt and identify missing answers
else Attempt was already submitted
  S --> U: Return existing result without another attempt or reward
else New complete submission
  alt Course quiz
    S --> U: Return score, correct answers, and explanations
    note over S
    Pass when exact percentage meets threshold.
    Preserve highest score and any previous pass.
    Optional quizzes do not affect course progress.
    Course progress displays 100% only when every required
    quiz in the Student's started revision is passed.
    Rounding keeps unfinished progress below 100%.
    All required quizzes passed: complete course
    and award its badge at most once.
    end note
  else Shared diagnostic
    S --> U: Return topic scores, correct answers, and explanations
    note over S
    15 questions; no pass/fail or badges.
    Latest completed result informs new suggestions.
    Earlier results stay saved.
    end note
  end
end
opt Connection drops during submission
  U -> S: Check result of the same submission
  S --> U: Return saved result, or allow retry if not submitted
end
note over U,S
Submitted answers cannot be edited.
Untimed, unlimited retakes create new attempts.
At most one unfinished attempt per quiz/assessment.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-11 | Product behavior
@enduml
